## Data is licensed separately

This license covers Erytheon's **code only**. It does not grant any rights to
third-party datasets Erytheon reads or references (NASA FIRMS, Météo-France,
ECMWF, Open-Meteo, BDIFF, Prométhée, OpenStreetMap, CORINE Land Cover, INSEE,
administrative boundaries, etc.). Each of those sources has its own license
and attribution terms. See [`docs/data-sources.md`](docs/data-sources.md) for
a per-source breakdown, including which sources are and are not redistributed
in this repository, and [`NOTICE.md`](NOTICE.md) for a quick attribution
reference.
